ady-for-review`;\"}],[\"/quickstart-33\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-33\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#1-create-the-private-demo-repository\",\"content\":\"**cleanup** — closed issues labelled both `clankpipe:review-complete` and `clankpipe:cleanup-approved`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-34\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-34\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-mode-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"Start ClankPipe from the standalone repository:\"}],[\"/quickstart-35\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-35\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-mode-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"The launcher uses Herdr when the process runs inside Herdr, Zellij when it runs inside Zellij, and then the first supported desktop terminal. Set `CLANKPIPE_LAUNCHER` to select one explicitly:\"}],[\"/quickstart-36\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-36\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-mode-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"From another terminal, list the seeded issues and release two of them:\"}],[\"/quickstart-37\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-37\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-mode-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"GitHub Search can take several seconds to index a label change. On the next matching run, ClankPipe creates or reuses the issue worktree, installs its JavaScript dependencies with Bun, and launches Pi through the selected launcher.\"}],[\"/quickstart-38\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-38\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"The implementation Pi session reads the issue and implements its written acceptance criteria. On commit, Husky runs lint-staged and ESLint against staged HTML and CSS files. Pi fixes hook failures, pushes, and creates or updates a PR containing `Closes #<issue>`. It then moves the issue to `clankpipe:ready-for-review`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-39\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-39\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"The review Source launches a separate reviewer Pi session in the same issue worktree:\"}],[\"/quickstart-40\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-40\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"**Pass:** Pi comments with review evidence, approves and merges the PR, and applies `clankpipe:review-complete`. Confirm that the issue is closed.\"}],[\"/quickstart-41\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-41\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"**Changes requested:** Pi comments, applies `clankpipe:changes-requested`, and returns the issue to `clankpipe:ready-for-agent`. The implementation Source launches another Pi session in the existing worktree.\"}],[\"/quickstart-42\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-42\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"After an accepted PR is merged, apply `clankpipe:cleanup-approved` to its closed issue. The cleanup Source removes the issue worktree.\"}],[\"/quickstart-43\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-43\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#4-tear-down-the-throwaway-demo\",\"content\":\"Stop ClankPipe with <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>C</kbd>. Record the repository name, then delete the private GitHub repository:\"}],[\"/quickstart-44\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-44\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#4-tear-down-the-throwaway-demo\",\"content\":\"GitHub may require the `delete_repo` scope. Grant it and retry if deletion fails:\"}],[\"/quickstart-45\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-45\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#4-tear-down-the-throwaway-demo\",\"content\":\"After remote deletion succeeds, leave the directory and remove the local throwaway clone.\"}],[\"/why\",{\"id\":\"/why\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Why ClankPipe\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"ClankPipe\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why\"}],[\"/why-0\",{\"id\":\"/why-0\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#why-clankpipe\",\"content\":\"Why ClankPipe\"}],[\"/why-1\",{\"id\":\"/why-1\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-clankpipe\",\"content\":\"Task trackers are good at tracking. Agents need repeatable local work queues.\"}],[\"/why-2\",{\"id\":\"/why-2\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-clankpipe\",\"content\":\"ClankPipe copies task-like items from sources like QMD-backed markdown into a local store, then runs configured actions such as creating worktrees and launching commands.\"}],[\"/why-3\",{\"id\":\"/why-3\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-clankpipe\",\"content\":\"ClankPipe is deliberately not a tracker replacement. Keep truth upstream. Use ClankPipe as the local automation bridge.\"}],[\"/cli/actions\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Actions\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"ClankPipe\",\"Cli\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions\"}],[\"/cli/actions-0\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-0\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Actions\"}],[\"/cli/actions-1\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-1\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#workspace-shape\",\"content\":\"Workspace Shape\"}],[\"/cli/actions-2\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-2\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"Execution Order\"}],[\"/cli/actions-3\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-3\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#retry-identity\",\"content\":\"Retry Identity\"}],[\"/cli/actions-4\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-4\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#action-docs\",\"content\":\"Action Docs\"}],[\"/cli/actions-5\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-5\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#trust-model\",\"content\":\"Trust Model\"}],[\"/cli/actions-6\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-6\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Actions are side effects that run for each Item collected from a Source.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-7\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-7\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Define them in the `sources.actions` array in your workspace config.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-8\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-8\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Each action is a sequential step that runs for each item in the source. Actions are blocking per item.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-9\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-9\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"This CLI doc only covers orchestration: ordering, retry identity, and trust model. Action-specific config belongs in each action package doc.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-10\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-10\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"Sources run concurrently. Item Actions inside one Source are serial.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-11\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-11\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"For each Item returned by a Source, ClankPipe executes Actions in the order defined in the `sources.actions` array.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-12\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-12\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"Actions are blocking per item. If action `0` fails for an item, action `1` for that item does not run during that Run.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-13\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-13\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"An Action can define an optional `open` command. The TUI runs this command when you press `O` in the Action Item view. The command uses the same MiniJinja context as Action inputs.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-14\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-14\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#retry-identity\",\"content\":\"An Action runs when no previous successful attempt exists for:\"}],[\"/cli/actions-15\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-15\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#retry-identity\",\"content\":\"Changing the rendered inputs changes the hash and makes the Action eligible to run again.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-16\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-16\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#retry-identity\",\"content\":\"Failed Actions retry on the next `run`, including `run --watch`, until they succeed.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-17\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-17\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#action-docs\",\"content\":\"`@clankpipe/action-worktree`\"}],[\"/cli/actions-18\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-18\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#action-docs\",\"content\":\"`@clankpipe/action-run-cmd`\"}],[\"/cli/actions-19\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-19\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#trust-model\",\"content\":\"Workspace configs are trusted local code, like a `Makefile`. ClankPipe does not sandbox commands.\"}],[\"/cli/commands\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Commands\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"ClankPipe\",\"Cli\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands\"}],[\"/cli/commands-0\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-0\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands#commands\",\"content\":\"Commands\"}],[\"/cli/commands-1\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-1\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands#workspace\",\"content\":\"`workspace`\"}],[\"/cli/commands-2\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-2\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands#run\",\"content\":\"`run`\"}],[\"/cli/commands-3\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-3\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands#list\",\"content\":\"`list`\"}],[\"/cli/commands-4\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-4\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands#show\",\"content\":\"`show`\"}],[\"/cli/commands-5\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-5\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands#tui\",\"content\":\"`tui`\"}],[\"/cli/commands-6\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-6\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands#doctor\",\"content\":\"`doctor`\"}],[\"/cli/commands-7\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-7\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/commands#schema\",\"content\":\"`schema`\"}],[\"/cli/commands-8\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-8\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#commands\",\"content\":\"Operational commands accept a Workspace path. If omitted, they use `.clankpipe.toml` in the current directory. ClankPipe does not search parent directories.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-9\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-9\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#workspace\",\"content\":\"Create an empty Workspace. The command creates the path you provide and does not overwrite an existing file:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-10\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-10\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#workspace\",\"content\":\"List TOML files in the platform config directory under `clankpipe`. On Linux, this is normally `~/.config/clankpipe`. The output is a JSON array of file stems:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-11\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-11\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#workspace\",\"content\":\"Open a Workspace in `$EDITOR`:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-12\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-12\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#workspace\",\"content\":\"`EDITOR` must contain an executable command. ClankPipe passes the absolute Workspace path as its only argument.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-13\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-13\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#workspace\",\"content\":\"`clankpipe workspaces` remains an alias for `clankpipe workspace list`.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-14\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-14\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#run\",\"content\":\"Collect Items, commit a Source Snapshot, render Actions, and execute pending Actions:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-15\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-15\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#run\",\"content\":\"Dry run collects Items and renders Actions. It does not acquire the Workspace lock, write Store files, or execute Actions:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-16\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-16\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#run\",\"content\":\"Watch Mode repeats normal Runs until Ctrl-C. The default interval is 60 seconds. A watched dry run performs one dry Run and then exits.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-17\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-17\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#run\",\"content\":\"`--interval` accepts seconds with an optional `s`, such as `30` or `30s`.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-18\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-18\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#run\",\"content\":\"Use `--json` or `--output-format json` for structured Run output. Use global `--quiet`, `--verbose`, `--color`, or `--log-file` flags for output control.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-19\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-19\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#list\",\"content\":\"List Items from the latest committed Snapshot for each configured Source:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-20\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-20\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#list\",\"content\":\"JSON output contains `source_id`, `snapshot`, `collection_status`, and `items`. Each Item result is `success`, `error`, or `pending`. A missing Snapshot is different from a committed empty Snapshot.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-21\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-21\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#list\",\"content\":\"`list --watch` refreshes the Store view in a terminal. It cannot use `--json` or redirected stdout.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-22\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-22\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#show\",\"content\":\"Show one stored Item and its Action attempts:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-23\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-23\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#show\",\"content\":\"The short form uses `.clankpipe.toml`. The command matches either `item.id` or `item.reference_id`. `show --watch` refreshes the human view and cannot use `--json` or redirected stdout.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-24\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-24\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#tui\",\"content\":\"Open the experimental OpenTUI shell:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-25\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-25\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#tui\",\"content\":\"The TUI requires a terminal. It shows one focused Workspace tree. Source, Action, and Item details open in drawers.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-26\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-26\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#doctor\",\"content\":\"Validate a Workspace and its local environment:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-27\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-27\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#doctor\",\"content\":\"The command checks Source configuration, Action configuration, and package-specific health requirements. It prints JSON and exits with status `1` when a check reports an error.\"}],[\"/cli/commands-28\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-28\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#schema\",\"content\":\"Print the JSON Schema built from the registered Source and Action packages:\"}],[\"/cli/commands-29\",{\"id\":\"/cli/commands-29\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/commands\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/commands#schema\",\"content\":\"The schema describes structure and types. It does not express every semantic rule, such as unique Source ids, non-empty Source maps, or required built-in Action inputs.\"}],[\"/cli/sources\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Sources\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"ClankPipe\",\"Cli\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/sources\"}],[\"/cli/sources-0\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-0\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/sources#sources\",\"content\":\"Sources\"}],[\"/cli/sources-1\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-1\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/sources#workspace-shape\",\"content\":\"Workspace Shape\"}],[\"/cli/sources-2\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-2\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/sources#execution-order\",\"content\":\"Execution Order\"}],[\"/cli/sources-3\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-3\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"Normalized Item Shape\"}],[\"/cli/sources-4\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-4\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/sources#source-docs\",\"content\":\"Source Docs\"}],[\"/cli/sources-5\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-5\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"CLI-Owned Behavior\"}],[\"/cli/sources-6\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-6\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#sources\",\"content\":\"A Source reads items from an external or local system.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-7\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-7\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#sources\",\"content\":\"This CLI doc only covers how Sources fit into a Workspace.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-8\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-8\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#sources\",\"content\":\"For Source-specific config and behavior, see the specific source docs.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-9\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-9\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#execution-order\",\"content\":\"A workspace can define multiple Sources, and they can be sources of the same or different kinds.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-10\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-10\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#execution-order\",\"content\":\"They are run concurrently, and when a source has finished retrieving items, its Actions are run sequentially for each item.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-11\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-11\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"After downloading or reading items from a source, clankpipe normalizes them into a small model that is stored in the Workspace store.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-12\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-12\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"They are stored in a common shape, so Actions can be written to work with any Source.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-13\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-13\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"Every Source produces normalized items:\"}],[\"/cli/sources-14\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-14\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`id`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-15\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-15\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`reference_id`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-16\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-16\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`title`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-17\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-17\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`status`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-18\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-18\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`url`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-19\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-19\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`source_id`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-20\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-20\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`source_kind`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-21\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-21\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`raw`\"}],[\"/cli/sources-22\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-22\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`raw` keeps the original Source payload so the normalized model can stay small.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-23\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-23\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"`id` is the adapter-owned, collision-resistant identity used by the Store and\\nAction retry checks. `reference_id` is the provider-facing identifier intended\\nfor templates, such as GitHub `10` or Jira `ABC-123`.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-24\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-24\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#normalized-item-shape\",\"content\":\"For Sources with field mapping, the existing `field_map.id` or `map.id` setting\\nselects `reference_id`. It never changes `id`.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-25\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-25\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#source-docs\",\"content\":\"QMD source\"}],[\"/cli/sources-26\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-26\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#source-docs\",\"content\":\"Jira source\"}],[\"/cli/sources-27\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-27\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#source-docs\",\"content\":\"GitHub source\"}],[\"/cli/sources-28\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-28\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"The CLI validates Source ids before a Run:\"}],[\"/cli/sources-29\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-29\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"Source ids must be nonempty.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-30\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-30\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"Source ids must be unique within one Workspace.\"}],[\"/cli/sources-31\",{\"id\":\"/cli/sources-31\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/sources\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/sources#cli-owned-behavior\",\"content\":\"Source packages own Source-specific validation and collection behavior.\"}],[\"/cli/store\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Store\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"ClankPipe\",\"Cli\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store\"}],[\"/cli/store-0\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-0\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#store\",\"content\":\"Store\"}],[\"/cli/store-1\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-1\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Location\"}],[\"/cli/store-2\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-2\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"Workspace lock\"}],[\"/cli/store-3\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-3\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"Source collection status\"}],[\"/cli/store-4\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-4\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`items-<source.slug>.jsonl`\"}],[\"/cli/store-5\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-5\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"`actions-<source.slug>-<source.hash>.jsonl`\"}],[\"/cli/store-6\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-6\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"Action Plan Result\"}],[\"/cli/store-7\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-7\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#inspecting-by-hand\",\"content\":\"Inspecting by hand\"}],[\"/cli/store-8\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-8\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/store#store-schema-migration\",\"content\":\"Store schema migration\"}],[\"/cli/store-9\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-9\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#store\",\"content\":\"The Store contains ClankPipe's append-only records of Item observations, Source\\nSnapshot boundaries, and Action attempts. It also contains the latest collection\\nstatus for each Source.\"}],[\"/cli/store-10\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-10\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#store\",\"content\":\"It is not the source of truth. The tracker or markdown collection remains the source of truth.\"}],[\"/cli/store-11\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-11\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"ClankPipe stores data under the user's XDG data directory:\"}],[\"/cli/store-12\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-12\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"`source.slug` identifies the upstream item universe. For Jira, it is derived from the normalized site URL because Jira issue keys are only unique inside one Jira organization. Two Jira Sources for the same site and different JQL views share an item file.\"}],[\"/cli/store-13\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-13\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"`source.hash` identifies the configured Source view and Action plan. Changing JQL or field mappings creates a new Source Snapshot identity. Changing Actions creates a different Action file without duplicating the Item Store.\"}],[\"/cli/store-14\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-14\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Each `items-<source.slug>.snapshots` record commits one complete Source Snapshot.\\nThe identity includes the configured Source ID, Source kind, and normalized Source\\nconfig. It excludes Actions. A failed or incomplete Run does not replace the\\nlatest committed Snapshot. A committed empty Snapshot is valid.\"}],[\"/cli/store-15\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-15\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Sources that share an Item Store keep separate Snapshot membership and their\\nsource-specific normalized Item values.\"}],[\"/cli/store-16\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-16\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"The global `--log-file` option appends one structured `run.complete` event to the given JSONL path. ClankPipe does not create `events.jsonl` in the Store.\"}],[\"/cli/store-17\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-17\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#location\",\"content\":\"Legacy `sources/<source-id>/items.jsonl` and `sources/<source-id>/actions.jsonl` files are not migrated automatically.\"}],[\"/cli/store-18\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-18\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"Normal `run` and non-dry `run --watch` acquire `run.lock` for the Workspace.\"}],[\"/cli/store-19\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-19\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"`run --dry-run` skips the lock and does not write Store files.\"}],[\"/cli/store-20\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-20\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"`run --watch --dry-run` skips the lock and does not write Store files.\"}],[\"/cli/store-21\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-21\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"A non-dry watched Run holds the lock until it exits.\"}],[\"/cli/store-22\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-22\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#workspace-lock\",\"content\":\"Overlapping normal Runs for the same Workspace fail.\"}],[\"/cli/store-23\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-23\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"Each normal Run writes one `collection-status.json` file for each Source. The\\nstatus is `collecting`, `complete`, `failed`, or `cancelled`.\"}],[\"/cli/store-24\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-24\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"`collecting` means that the Source query is running.\"}],[\"/cli/store-25\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-25\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"`complete` means that the query succeeded and the Snapshot was committed.\"}],[\"/cli/store-26\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-26\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"`failed` means that the query returned an error. The file keeps a short error message.\"}],[\"/cli/store-27\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-27\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"`cancelled` means that collection stopped before the query completed.\"}],[\"/cli/store-28\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-28\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"The file keeps the latest status and its update time. If the file says\\n`collecting` but the Workspace lock is free, the TUI treats the status as\\n`cancelled`. Collection status does not replace the authoritative Source\\nSnapshot.\"}],[\"/cli/store-29\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-29\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#source-collection-status\",\"content\":\"The Store also keeps an append-only Source Fetch Log. Each collection event\\nrecords the Source status, time, and error when collection fails. The TUI shows the full log in the Source drawer.\"}],[\"/cli/store-30\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-30\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"Each line is one normalized item observation.\"}],[\"/cli/store-31\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-31\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"Each Item contains both identities:\"}],[\"/cli/store-32\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-32\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`id` — adapter-owned identity used for Store and Action matching.\"}],[\"/cli/store-33\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-33\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`reference_id` — provider-facing reference available to templates.\"}],[\"/cli/store-34\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-34\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"A new Run appends new observations. It does not rewrite older lines.\"}],[\"/cli/store-35\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-35\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`list` reads the latest committed Source Snapshot for each configured Source.\\nIt groups output in Workspace order and does not infer current membership from\\nolder Item records. JSON output contains one object per Source and keeps\\nmissing and ready-empty Snapshots distinct.\"}],[\"/cli/store-36\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-36\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#items-sourceslugjsonl\",\"content\":\"`show` uses committed Source Snapshot membership. Older Item observations without\\nSnapshot boundaries are not eligible for `show`.\"}],[\"/cli/store-37\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-37\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"Each line is one Action attempt.\"}],[\"/cli/store-38\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-38\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"Action attempts include:\"}],[\"/cli/store-39\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-39\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"timestamp\"}],[\"/cli/store-40\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-40\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"source id\"}],[\"/cli/store-41\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-41\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"item id\"}],[\"/cli/store-42\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-42\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"source Action index\"}],[\"/cli/store-43\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-43\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"Action name\"}],[\"/cli/store-44\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-44\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"rendered Action hash\"}],[\"/cli/store-45\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-45\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"outcome (`success`, `failure`, or `cancelled`)\"}],[\"/cli/store-46\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-46\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"stdout\"}],[\"/cli/store-47\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-47\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"stderr\"}],[\"/cli/store-48\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-48\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"message\"}],[\"/cli/store-49\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-49\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#actions-sourceslug-sourcehashjsonl\",\"content\":\"Successful attempts are used to skip completed work on later Runs.\"}],[\"/cli/store-50\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-50\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"`list` and `tui` derive one result from the current rendered Action\\nidentities for each Item:\"}],[\"/cli/store-51\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-51\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"`success` — every current Action identity succeeded, or no Actions exist.\"}],[\"/cli/store-52\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-52\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"`error` — an Action cannot render, or its latest attempt failed.\"}],[\"/cli/store-53\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-53\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"`pending` — every other state, including cancelled attempts and changed\\nrendered inputs.\"}],[\"/cli/store-54\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-54\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"A later successful attempt replaces an older failure for the same current\\nAction identity.\"}],[\"/cli/store-55\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-55\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"Cancelled attempts remain eligible for retry on the next Run.\"}],[\"/cli/store-56\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-56\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#action-plan-result\",\"content\":\"This is display state, not tracker state.\"}],[\"/cli/store-57\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-57\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#inspecting-by-hand\",\"content\":\"The Store records are plain JSONL, and collection status files are JSON. Use normal shell tools:\"}],[\"/cli/store-58\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-58\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#store-schema-migration\",\"content\":\"`reference_id` is required in Item records. Stores created before this field was\\nadded are intentionally not migrated automatically. Remove the affected\\n`items-<source.slug>.jsonl` file and run the Workspace again to rebuild it.\"}],[\"/cli/store-59\",{\"id\":\"/cli/store-59\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/store\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/store#store-schema-migration\",\"content\":\"Keeping the Action Store preserves its records, but Jira, QMD, and GitHub\\nSources with `field_map.id` changed Item identities with this schema. Their old\\nsuccessful attempts do not suppress Actions for the rebuilt Items. Review or\\ntemporarily disable configured Actions before the rebuilding Run if repeating\\nthem could cause duplicate side effects.\"}],[\"/cli/templates\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Templates\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"ClankPipe\",\"Cli\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/templates\"}],[\"/cli/templates-0\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-0\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/templates#templates\",\"content\":\"Templates\"}],[\"/cli/templates-1\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-1\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"Context\"}],[\"/cli/templates-2\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-2\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/templates#filters\",\"content\":\"Filters\"}],[\"/cli/templates-3\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-3\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/templates#rendering-and-expansion-order\",\"content\":\"Rendering and expansion order\"}],[\"/cli/templates-4\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-4\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/templates#action-hash\",\"content\":\"Action hash\"}],[\"/cli/templates-5\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-5\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/templates#examples\",\"content\":\"Examples\"}],[\"/cli/templates-6\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-6\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#templates\",\"content\":\"Action inputs are MiniJinja templates.\"}],[\"/cli/templates-7\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-7\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"Templates can read:\"}],[\"/cli/templates-8\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-8\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"`workspace`\"}],[\"/cli/templates-9\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-9\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"`source`\"}],[\"/cli/templates-10\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-10\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"`item`\"}],[\"/cli/templates-11\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-11\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"`action`\"}],[\"/cli/templates-12\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-12\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"`actions` (preceding named Actions only)\"}],[\"/cli/templates-13\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-13\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"Example values:\"}],[\"/cli/templates-14\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-14\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"`source` is the complete configured Source. Adapter settings stay nested under\\n`source.source`, and configured Actions stay under `source.actions`.\"}],[\"/cli/templates-15\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-15\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"An Action may declare a Source-scoped `id`. Later Actions can read that named\\nAction's final rendered inputs through `actions.<id>.inputs`. Unnamed Actions are\\nabsent, and missing or forward references fail rendering for that Item.\"}],[\"/cli/templates-16\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-16\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"Stored-success skips and dry runs still render each Action in order, so later\\nActions receive freshly rendered named inputs. Action IDs do not change retry\\nidentity.\"}],[\"/cli/templates-17\",{\"id\":\"/cli/templates-17\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/templates\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/templates#context\",\"content\":\"Use `item.reference_id` for provider-facing names and messages. `item.id` is t